{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04099","headline":"御箭连中双兔 · 苏頲","name":"御箭连中双兔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宸游经上苑，羽猎向闲田。\n狡兔初迷窟，纤骊讵着鞭。\n三驱仍百步，一发遂双连。\n影射含霜草，魂消向月弦。\n欢声动寒木，喜气满晴天。\n那似陈王意，空随乐府篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}